    "detailed_description": "<i>Hi and welcome. We are <strong>Mr. Trees.</strong></i><br>Welcome to <strong>Finn's</strong> life! We've been waiting in this forest for decades, but finally we found someone to tell. Now you're here, you can listen to <strong>Finn's</strong> story!<br><br><strong>Finn,</strong> a high school student, lives in a town with his <strong>mother and friends.</strong><i>(She makes very nice pies.)</i><br>We remember him even as a child. He was a sweetheart! Unfortunately, he didn't see much of his father as a child. But, he has a lot of friends which are adorable. He hangs with them all day. We think their names were <strong>Guffie, Fluffy, Axy, Froggie, Foggie, Salsie. </strong> If we had to explain them:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209880/extras/e85d64ad84a16166d537155d7f67b09e.avif?t=1669832309\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209880/extras/539dba4f5ef3f644cbf8ed44203fb709.avif?t=1669832309\" /></div><br><strong>Guffie</strong>: The purple ghost.<br><strong>Fluffy</strong>: Cutest cat alive.<br><strong>Axy</strong>: The pink axolotl. <br><strong>Froggie</strong>: Frog laughing meme.<br><strong>Salsie</strong>: The shy tomato.<br><strong>Foggie</strong>: Tired from climate change.<br><br>Furthermore, we are super excited to see you. Don't miss this adventure! We'll be waiting for you!",
    "about_the_game": "<i>Hi and welcome. We are <strong>Mr. Trees.</strong></i><br>Welcome to <strong>Finn's</strong> life! We've been waiting in this forest for decades, but finally we found someone to tell. Now you're here, you can listen to <strong>Finn's</strong> story!<br><br><strong>Finn,</strong> a high school student, lives in a town with his <strong>mother and friends.</strong><i>(She makes very nice pies.)</i><br>We remember him even as a child. He was a sweetheart! Unfortunately, he didn't see much of his father as a child. But, he has a lot of friends which are adorable. He hangs with them all day. We think their names were <strong>Guffie, Fluffy, Axy, Froggie, Foggie, Salsie. </strong> If we had to explain them:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209880/extras/e85d64ad84a16166d537155d7f67b09e.avif?t=1669832309\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209880/extras/539dba4f5ef3f644cbf8ed44203fb709.avif?t=1669832309\" /></div><br><strong>Guffie</strong>: The purple ghost.<br><strong>Fluffy</strong>: Cutest cat alive.<br><strong>Axy</strong>: The pink axolotl. <br><strong>Froggie</strong>: Frog laughing meme.<br><strong>Salsie</strong>: The shy tomato.<br><strong>Foggie</strong>: Tired from climate change.<br><br>Furthermore, we are super excited to see you. Don't miss this adventure! We'll be waiting for you!",
